# Day-03 — AWS EBS & VPC Endpoints

## 📌 Day-03 Overview

Day-03 focused on two important AWS infrastructure concepts:

1. **Amazon EBS — Persistent Block Storage**
2. **VPC Endpoints — Private AWS Service Connectivity**

The goal was not only to understand the services, but to build them hands-on, verify the behavior, deliberately troubleshoot failures, and understand the production-level architecture decisions behind them.

